        '<strong>Direct email:</strong> if you write to us at <a href="mailto:contacto@asesoriamadal.es">contacto@asesoriamadal.es</a>, we process the data you include in your message in order to reply. <em>Legal basis:</em> legitimate interest in handling business enquiries / pre-contractual measures (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR). <em>Retention:</em> until the enquiry is resolved or, if no business relationship is formalised, for 6-12 months.',
